  "description": "The go-to hybrid for commutes and cruises\nMartis is the hybrid bike ready for whatever your day brings, commutes, workouts, or easy rides around the block. Its lightweight aluminum frame pairs with a 21-speed drivetrain that makes hills feel like flats. Mechanical disc brakes keep you stopping with confidence in any weather, while a Sport Comfort saddle and low-rise handlebars keep you upright and relaxed mile after mile. Grippy 700x35C tires handle pavement and everything between, and mounts on the frame and fork mean a rack or fenders are ready whenever you want them. Rated for riders up to 250 lbs, Martis is built for every kind of everyday ride.",
